    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d658">

                <pb facs="0919" n="813" sameAs="frus:frus1906p1/pg813"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        Minister Jackson.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1906-02-21"><hi rendition="#italic">February 21,
                        1906</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: The President having accepted the honorary
                    presidency of the American committee on the Olympic games at Athens, from April
                    22 to May 2, 1906, and the Government of Greece, through its consul-general at
                    New York, having invited this Government to be officially represented on the
                    occasion, you are, by the President’s direction, hereby designated to be his
                    representative at the games.</p>
                <p>I am, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Elihu Root.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
